%% Berry Exchange — supplementary: listing.created -> AI worker enrichment flow (Phase 2 skeleton)
sequenceDiagram
    participant Grower as Grower (Browser)
    participant API as Listings API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ (berry.events)
    participant Worker as AI Worker (ai-enrichment queue)

    Grower->>API: POST /api/listings
    API->>DB: INSERT listing
    DB-->>API: listing committed
    API-->>Grower: 201 Created
    API--)MQ: publish listing.created (best-effort, post-commit)
    MQ--)Worker: deliver listing.created (bound to ai-enrichment queue)
    Note over Worker: LoggingListingCreatedHandler.HandleAsync<br/>logs for now - Phase 3/4 swaps in real enrichment
    alt handler succeeds
        Worker--)MQ: ack
    else handler throws
        Worker--)MQ: nack (requeue false)
        Note over MQ: routes to berry.events.dlx then ai-enrichment.dead
    end
